  "summary": "Malicious code in ladash-cli (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook of ladash-cli (a typosquat of lodash) beacons the installer's platform/arch/node-version fingerprint to a hardcoded C2 at 193[.]70[.]34[.]101:20099 via HTTP POST to /vote. On Windows and WSL hosts it additionally downloads a second-stage binary main.exe from hxxps://github[.]com/beabraz1/qPzM50V1AKG0rVlH/release/download/main[.]exe into %TEMP% and launches it as a detached background process. The C2 host, port, and download URL are XOR-obfuscated in the script.",
